{"hw":"Πυθία1","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Πυθία1</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Πυθία</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">ἱέρεια</span>), <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Πυθίη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.13</span> </span>, al., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Call.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Iamb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.222</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>:— <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">Pythia, priestess of Pythian Apollo</b> at Delphi, who uttered the responses of the oracle, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> </span> l.c., etc.; cf. <span class=\"gk\">προφήτης</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"gk\">Πυθίη</span>, epith. of Artemis at Branchidae, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">CIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2866</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2885</span> </span>.</div></div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Πύθια2</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Πύθια</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">ἱερά</span>), <span class=\"lex-gram\">τά</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the Pythian games</b>, celebrated at Delphi in honour of Pythian Apollo, <span class=\"gk\">ἐν Πυθίοισι νικᾶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">N.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.9</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">Π. ἀνελόμενος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.122</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐνίκα τὰ Π. τῷ τεθρίππῳ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">59.33</span> </span>: also of festivals elsewhere, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.129</span> </span>, etc.</div></div>"}